<span class="cat-badge">Guide &middot; Pricing</span>
<h1>Yamaha Sirius Daily Rental Price in Hanoi: Cost Planning Guide</h1>
<p>The Yamaha Sirius rents at a verified 150,000 VND per day in Hanoi, sitting in the entry tier alongside the Honda Wave, Yamaha Mio and Honda Click at the same rate. This guide plans the daily rental around that number: what the rate buys, what it does not, when the daily rate is the right structure, and when the weekly rate takes over.</p>
<p>We cover the verified price, what the Sirius is as a machine, day-by-day budget planning, the break-even against the 700,000 VND weekly rate and the 900,000 to 1,200,000 VND monthly rate, and the extras, deposit, gear, fuel, that turn a headline rate into a real budget. Start at the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental-cost/">Hanoi motorbike rental cost</a> hub, see the full model range at the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental/">Hanoi motorbike rental</a> guide, and check common questions on the <a href="/faq/">rental FAQ</a>.</p>
<nav class="toc">
<ol>
<li><a href="#sec-1">The verified daily price</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-2">What the Sirius buys</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-3">Planning a daily budget</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-4">The break-even math</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-5">Sirius versus other daily rates</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-6">Deposits, gear and extras</a></li>
